    DYSG     [label="미각 이상 (미각소실/이상미각)\nDYSGEUSIA / AGEUSIA\ngefapixant 45 mg: 58-69%\nof patients"];
    DISCONT  [label="이상반응에 의한 중단\nTaste-related discontinuation\n≈15-20% at 45 mg BID"];
